1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,000
This video introduces the new update of Closet.

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:17,000
We have introduced a new function, the sticker editor, to improve your design ability.

3
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:25,000
As in Closet, users can now edit stickers on 3D clothing in Closet.

4
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,000
First, enter the content page.

5
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:34,000
On the right side, click the button to enter the new tool.

6
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:38,000
In the 3D tool bar, select the edit sticker tool.

7
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:41,000
Then click the sticker.

8
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:45,000
The sticker will show the shape controller around it.

9
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:49,000
We can use the shape controller to adjust the sticker.

10
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:53,000
First, drag the triangle around the controller.

11
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:58,000
You can adjust the width and length according to the proportion of the picture.

12
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:03,000
Another way is like this.

13
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:08,000
You can Veterans your village or habr Cloud.

14
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Drag the outer circle around the controller to rotate the picture.

15
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:26,000
Press the center key, and shift the key fo the controller.

16
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:29,000
You can now adjust the position.

17
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:32,739
Under the material option on the right, select the basic parameters.

18
00:01:35,739 --> 00:01:36,859
Click to replace the icon.

19
00:01:44,500 --> 00:01:46,400
Select the sticker from the folder.

20
00:01:47,700 --> 00:01:48,460
Click to open.

21
00:01:50,500 --> 00:01:52,599
Now the sticker has been replaced with a new icon.

22
00:01:54,859 --> 00:01:57,900
You can also adjust its position, proportion, angle, etc.

23
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:02,000
You can also adjust its position, proportion, etc.

24
00:02:03,400 --> 00:02:05,000
Through the sticker configuration tool,

25
00:02:06,099 --> 00:02:10,000
even those who do not have CLO software can also participate in the design and development.

26
00:02:18,699 --> 00:02:21,900
Now let's introduce another new function, content analysis.

27
00:02:22,500 --> 00:02:23,500
Through this function,

28
00:02:23,900 --> 00:02:27,199
you can actually check the progress and content activity analysis of the work process.

29
00:02:29,300 --> 00:02:29,699
First,

30
00:02:29,700 --> 00:02:30,700
go to the content page.

31
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:34,200
Click on the content analysis button in the upper right corner,

32
00:02:34,600 --> 00:02:36,400
then you can enter the content analysis page.

33
00:02:38,200 --> 00:02:41,000
The work process analysis provides the progress of the work process

34
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:43,200
and the draft of the development cycle.

35
00:02:47,400 --> 00:02:51,400
The total delivery cycle in the upper right corner shows the number of days passed since the content was created.

36
00:02:54,100 --> 00:02:57,900
The time axis in the middle shows the delivery cycle between each work flow state.

37
00:02:59,700 --> 00:03:01,000
This is where the time axis for all work flows.

38
00:03:01,200 --> 00:03:03,900
When the mouse is suspended in a specific work flow,

39
00:03:04,100 --> 00:03:06,600
it shows the number of activities in each status.

40
00:03:06,800 --> 00:03:11,400
You can see the upload, broadcast, communication, and download of its versions.

41
00:03:22,100 --> 00:03:23,200
Below the time axis,

42
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:25,800
the activity analysis provides a detailed activity date.

43
00:03:29,700 --> 00:03:39,700
In the upper right corner, you can switch to the display of bubble chart or pile chart.

44
00:03:39,700 --> 00:03:53,700
You can adjust the display area size by rolling.

45
00:03:53,700 --> 00:03:59,700
Through the activity analysis table, you can identify the fundamental reasons for extending the delivery period.

46
00:03:59,700 --> 00:04:11,700
We can quickly find out which activities are the most active and support our strategic decisions.

